      "heading": "B — Audience and scope",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience and scope\n\nAudience: first-time Iowa license applicants learning crossings, merges, unusual interchanges, roundabouts, and gravel beginnings, in plain English.\n\nPrerequisites: maneuver skills from prior sections are assumed; this section teaches complex-road navigation.\n\nScope note: intersections through gravel starts only. Rural, night, sharing, and weather finish in the next section.\n\nNavigation emphasis: ordered drills are practiced as step recall, so this section feeds the dedicated interchange-and-ring surface declared in part C.\n",
